      "downloads": 5023,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>Features (Every option is toggable in the config):</p>\n<p>- in depth configuration system that allows to change all of mod’s options PER BOT</p>\n<p>- Health changes, by default set to default player health</p>\n<p>- Give bosses that had no armor protection some of it (Reshala, Sanitar, Cultist Priest).</p>\n<p>- Removes OP skills from all of the bots (such as instant reloads and infinite stamina).</p>\n<p>SHOULD WORK WITH MOST MODS THAT CHANGE BOTS.</p>\n",
